Technically, no.  Extinction is based on a birth counter, not a kill
counter.  You can polymorph them into other monsters, or let your pets
finish them off.  The monster needs to be killed, but it doesn't have
to be in its original form, or killed specifically by you.

My one extinctionist only killed 53 black unicorns, the rest being
polymorphed into another monster before being killed.

